{"summary":"Build and manage the ultimate Japanese hot springs inn.","description":"Build your own resort and propel it to success with but a touch of the finger in this one-of-a-kind simulation!\n\nRooms, restaurants, arcades, and baths--position each facility to lull your guests into hot spring Nirvana and skyrocket your establishment to fame! \n\nCraft the perfect Japanese garden from lanterns, pine trees, azaleas, and more--you'll need it all if you want to attract VIPs like pop stars and novelists. \n\nThere can only be one #1! Do you have what it takes? \n\nTurn your device to rotate the screen, touch to scroll, and pinch to zoom in and out. \n\n--\nTry searching for \"Kairosoft\" to see all of our games, or visit us at https://kairopark.jp. Be sure to check out both our free-to-play and our paid games!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/evRxsbK5_hk?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/X2HAs5DUHUJhXaRxAwC5zNV6fd0Hai7o2OM2RgZg950IgaC3T-0wz6-AYLc5CATo35H_qJPkp886eoHCUnFBnpE","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/f8cv9sLpVT33XSIiDTRpvYzmkcU8NYW1cSLG9Afz2M5QeY9lKdGlT6CUMYPlcAR4jv6yh1Zmg0G1tKTGBAwlOw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ODJ81qlTSK1OtRTgcZ0_3Out3fY1ZduCjTl1GyZ_SKC5thmPWnZIKkm7OOlg5yh3UOb86oDBg8MdAL0EV9u2ZQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ADege9JzrlUnUITNpDru8AhmurrzIyT9qopgwyZTd06iwV_PdHN143TpzfKlqW8RUPyr7_8xxwFEZme2Sajl0g","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Un22alwNSnVo_46keLTT85MhUKfeK9DLBNmkPDamnAGzQNXVk-PupvKzDEaCLtWrRd0ImVoaPs0rBCKVjRwN","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DQxG8jCFaZXGKufNzivEMg0CldHUtrUbVycj1MhQ0vLsSalHvqIfyETUOVN_cnSIINUf9CbNpoxH2RF6d0xnOQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-aNFQgTfUrwi_56rLY_RV5OGSX_MI8PueqnPOpiojUB5zte9jTnMAsrEwuqSRW6YDtPtt1u_WfSxT4PbimTz5w0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kYLMOCyKLqFdYNOiOKHtGeWJYgPBfFSMfAdlMmHPUNeyT4fjqc31FJW0kfET5l-dDurrdYgh4JOUCL-vd8diOw